  "notes": "{弱|よわ}まる is an intransitive verb meaning to weaken or diminish.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n- Pair: {弱|よわ}める (transitive) - to weaken something\n\nVERB PAIR EXAMPLES:\n- {風|かぜ}が{弱|よわ}まった: The wind weakened (intransitive)\n- {音|おと}を{弱|よわ}める: to lower the sound (transitive)\n\nRELATED {弱|よわ} VERBS:\n- {弱|よわ}まる: to weaken (change/process)\n- {弱|よわ}める: to weaken something (transitive)\n- {弱|よわ}る: to become weak (resulting state)\n\nCOMMON SUBJECTS:\n- {風|かぜ}が{弱|よわ}まる: wind weakens\n- {勢|いきお}いが{弱|よわ}まる: momentum weakens\n- {痛|いた}みが{弱|よわ}まる: pain subsides\n- {影響力|えいきょうりょく}が{弱|よわ}まる: influence weakens\n\nOPPOSITE:\n- {強|つよ}まる: to strengthen, intensify",
